# docs environment
#
# There is nothing to set. This file exists to say so, because "which
# variables does the docs project need" is a reasonable question and an
# empty settings page is an ambiguous answer.

# The documentation site is static files and nothing else: no serverless
# functions, no API routes, no database, no secrets. Pages are Markdown
# fetched by the browser and rendered client side.
#
# Vercel project settings for uwufeed-docs:
#   Root directory     docs
#   Framework preset   Other
#   Build command      none
#   Output directory   none
#   Environment        empty
#
# If a variable ever does appear here, something has been added that reads
# it at runtime, and that is worth questioning first: this site is
# deliberately incapable of leaking anything, because it holds nothing.
